      "description": "Established in 2017, TYPE ONE STABLE BAR has rapidly risen to become Malaysia\u2019s premier manufacturer of multi-point chassis-strengthening bars. Unlike conventional 2-point bars, TYPE ONE multi-point stable bars distribute torsional stress evenly across the chassis without compromising cabin comfort or requiring any welding.",
